msgid "Two ways data arrives"
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:894
msgid "<strong>Feeds</strong> pull from a URL or a file. <strong>Servers</strong> are two-way links to other MISP instances. Both live under Sync."
